The conversions in dk.simongray.colour-coded.space and the gamut mapping in
dk.simongray.colour-coded.gamut follow the sample code and pseudocode of CSS
Color Module Level 4, https://www.w3.org/TR/css-color-4/, which is
Copyright © 2026 World Wide Web Consortium, under the W3C Software and
Document License, https://www.w3.org/copyright/software-license/. The
matrices are the spec's, and the code is rewritten in Clojure.
